<title>USA: IGI settles with J&amp;J.</title>
<headline>IGI settles with J&amp;J.</headline>
<dateline>BUENA, N.J. 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>IGI Inc said Monday it has reached a settlement with Johnson &amp; Johnson on that company's complaint that IGI's use of the names Nova Skin and Nova Skin Care infringe on rights Johnson &amp; Johnson has in its trademark Renova.</p>
<p>Terms of the settlement were not disclosed, IGI said, noting it was reached &quot;in anticipation of future business relationships.&quot;</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
